# Two Sum — the most famous interview question there is: find the pair of
# numbers that sums to 2020 (the Advent of Code 2020 Day 1 flavor).
#
# Named naively as an all-pairs scan; run with --explain to watch the
# optimizer swap in the O(n) hash-set scan.
#
#   domain challenges/02_two_sum.domain
Cursed Energy: 02_two_sum.input
Shikigami: Ints
Domain Expansion: All Pairs
    Mode: First
    Using: (a, b) -> a + b = 2020
Reveal: stdout
